    "value": "# Given a shopper clicks Find My Size or Size -& Fit-Guide on a PDP where Measmerize is not configured for the product, when the link is clicked, then a slide-out overlay opens without navigating away from the PDP.\n# Given the size guide slide-out is open, when the shopper views it, then size -& fit- guide description (mandatory) and the conversion tables (optional, can be up to 3 tables: Size Conversions, Body Measurements, and Garment Measurements) appropriate to the selected product type are displayed.\n# Given the size guide slide-out is open, when the shopper toggles between cm and inches, then all measurements update to reflect the selected unit.\n# Given size guide content has been updated in Contentful for a product type, when the shopper opens the size guide slide-out, then the updated content is displayed without requiring a code deployment.\n# Given the size guide slide-out is open on any device, when the shopper views it, then the slide-out is fully responsive across mobile, tablet, and desktop.\n\n*Mobile-specific*\n\n# Given the size guide slide-out is open on a mobile device, when the shopper views it, then the table is partially displayed and the sizes on the most righthand side of the table peek out so that the shopper knows they can scroll to the right."
  }
